493	/// Whether the semantic fallback may run. Default OFF: a lexical miss used
494	/// to load the embedding model and embed up to
495	/// [`SEMANTIC_FALLBACK_MAX_FILES`] files inside the daemon request — the
496	/// worst tail on the hot path. `PIXEL_SEMANTIC_FALLBACK=1` (or `true`,
497	/// `yes`, `on`) re-enables it; any other value keeps it off. Read once per
498	/// process.
